  "termsTitle": "Terms of service",
  "privacyBody": "Rove collects only what is needed to run your rentals: your name, email, phone number, country, booking history and the driving licence and ID documents you upload.\n\nDocuments are stored privately and shared only with the rental company handling your booking, through short-lived secure links. Rental companies never see your email address or date of birth.\n\nPayments are handled by our payment provider; Rove never stores your card details.\n\nYou can request deletion of your account from your profile at any time. Some booking records are kept where the law requires it.",
  "termsBody": "Rove is a marketplace. Your rental agreement is with the rental company shown on your booking.\n\nPrices shown at checkout are calculated by Rove and include taxes and service fees. The refundable deposit is held at pickup and released after the return inspection.\n\nCancellation fees follow the policy shown on the car and on your booking. Refunds are complete only when the payment provider confirms them.\n\nThe driver must be at least 21, hold a valid driving licence and bring the documents uploaded to Rove to pickup."
